5,"watchRatio":0.44049999999999995},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4325},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4233},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.41100000000000003},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.3969},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3918}],"script":{"source_path":"TXoCnsFjIUU.en-orig.vtt","words":189,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"This video of Mother Mary dressed as"},{"sec":2,"text":"Mother Durga started a massive fight"},{"sec":4.1,"text":"online, but the church has been doing"},{"sec":5.8,"text":"this for 1,500 years and it started in a"},{"sec":8.4,"text":"temple in Greece. The Greeks worshipped"},{"sec":10.6,"text":"a virgin goddesses called [music] Athena"},{"sec":12.4,"text":"and a temple in Athens, the Parthenon,"},{"sec":14.6,"text":"was turned into a church of the Virgin"},{"sec":16.4,"text":"Mary. And as Christianity spread west,"},{"sec":18.6,"text":"Mary picked up the attributes of"},{"sec":20.3,"text":"Artemis, too. And it gets crazy. Her"},{"sec":22.3,"text":"festival of torches fell on 15th of"},{"sec":24.4,"text":"August. Today, that is the exact day"},{"sec":26.2,"text":"church celebrates Mary rising into"},{"sec":28,"text":"heaven. It didn't stop in Europe. When"},{"sec":29.8,"text":"the church reached South America, it did"},{"sec":31.5,"text":"something even stranger. The locals"},{"sec":33.4,"text":"worshipped Pachamama, the Mother Earth."},{"sec":35,"text":"So, colonial painters literally painted"},{"sec":37.1,"text":"Mary as a mountain. So, who said this"},{"sec":39,"text":"was allowed? Well, Saint Augustine"},{"sec":40.9,"text":"argued that Christians could take gold"},{"sec":42.9,"text":"of pagan culture and use it for God. So,"},{"sec":45.2,"text":"the Durga video isn't new. India already"},{"sec":47.2,"text":"[music] has it at Velankanni, where Mary"},{"sec":49.4,"text":"is draped in a sari. The church even has"},{"sec":51.5,"text":"an official name for this,"},{"sec":52.7,"text":"inculturation. It isn't a viral stunt."},{"sec":55,"text":"It's a 1,500-year-old playbook."}],"text":""}}